note Trigger: REMOVE_STEP, a danger button (red under the pointer) at the far right of the header, drawn only for steps of the tour being read (not inline occurrences), queues RemoveStep. Its click only counts when the pointer moved since the last click (danger_button), so clicking twice on a resting pointer deletes one step, not the one that slid under it.

